sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Consumer
    participant L as Condition (lock + waiting room)
    participant P as Producer
    C->>L: with cond → acquire the lock
    C->>C: while not items → the fact is false
    C->>L: cond.wait()
    Note over C,L: wait() RELEASES the lock and sleeps —<br/>otherwise no producer could ever get in
    P->>L: with cond → acquire the lock
    P->>P: items.append(x)
    P->>L: cond.notify()
    P->>L: leaving the with block releases the lock
    L-->>C: woken up
    C->>L: re-acquire the lock (automatic)
    C->>C: re-check `while not items` — now true, take the item
    Note over C: the loop is `while`, never `if`:<br/>a wake-up is a hint, not a guarantee
